<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[Project-domain run (model_domain=PROJECT) at Rates scale of the chained processes on project-crankcase's network: crankcase running (15), start (16) and extended idle (17) exhaust with their parents running (1), start (2) and extended idle (90), THC and CO; and the refueling losses, displacement vapor (18) and spillage (19), THC, whose Total Energy parents MOVES adds. Gasoline passenger cars and diesel long-haul trucks; two on-network links on road types 4 and 5 (a second link at Rates scale) and the off-network link 3 with the user's start modes. The post-processor's PROJECT branch divides processes 1, 15, 18 and 19 by the link's average speed for RatePerDistance; 2, 16, 17, 90 go to RatePerVehicle and 17, 90 to RatePerHour. Snapshot capture supplies the project DB from county-inputs/washtenaw-project-crankcase/setup-project-crankcase.sql.]]></description>
